hats · Noise&#xa;Add Health and Sports Records" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="328" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="Module 5 · Generate Timestamped QA&#xa;Create Questions during Daily Simulation&#xa;Supplement Phone Data for Answerability Gaps&#xa;Produce Multiple-choice and Short Answers" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="328" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="Filter and Review Data Quality&#xa;LLM Removes Non-self-contained Items&#xa;Manual Review Rewrites Unreasonable QA&#xa;Score Realism · Relations · Trips · Diversity" style="ellipse;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="328" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="Release 10 One-year User Histories&#xa;5,149 Events per User · about 14 per Day&#xa;8,046 Phone and Health Records per User&#xa;2,003 Questions · 517 MCQ + 1,486 Short" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="328" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="Normalize and Evalua